<div id="main-container">
<h1>Q’UNODLE CHUX GILEG<br/>(Christmas songs)</h1>
<h2>Jim Dementi</h2>
<div id="controls-holder">
<div id="audio-holder"></div>
</div>
<div id="window"></div>
<div id="text">
<ol><li><p class='igt' id='i0'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/gixidaghdetth'iq.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i0w'><span class="word" id="i0w0">Gixidaghdetth’iq.</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i0g'><span class="gloss" id="i0g0"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i0ft'>It’s quiet.</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i1'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/xitidlu'odi_xidhu'onh.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i1w'><span class="word" id="i1w0">Xitidlu’odi</span><span class="word" id="i1w1">xidhu’onh.</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i1g'><span class="gloss" id="i1g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i1g1"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i1ft'>It’s holy.</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i2'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/yuxudz_deghatl_yuxudz_xili'an'.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i2w'><span class="word" id="i2w0">Yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i2w1">deghatl,</span><span class="word" id="i2w2">yuxudz</span><span class="word" id="i2w3">xili’an’.</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i2g'><span class="gloss" id="i2g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i2g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i2g2"></span><span class="gloss" id="i2g3"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i2ft'>All is calm. All is bright.</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i3'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/dinaxito'_viya'_xethdlanh.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i3w'><span class="word" id="i3w0">Dinaxito’</span><span class="word" id="i3w1">Viya’</span><span class="word" id="i3w2">xethdlanh.</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i3g'><span class="gloss" id="i3g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i3g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i3g2"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i3ft'>Our Father’s Son was born.</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i4'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/vits'ixili'an'_tr'i'ne.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i4w'><span class="word" id="i4w0">Vits’i</span><span class="word" id="i4w1">xili’an’</span><span class="word" id="i4w2">tr’i’ne.</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i4g'><span class="gloss" id="i4g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i4g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i4g2"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i4ft'>They say there was a bright light from him.</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i5'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/yoye_nixalyiyh.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i5w'><span class="word" id="i5w0">Yoye</span><span class="word" id="i5w1">nixalyiyh.</span><span class="word" id="i5w2">Yoye</span><span class="word" id="i5w3">nixalyiyh.</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i5g'><span class="gloss" id="i5g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i5g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i5g2"></span><span class="gloss" id="i5g3"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i5ft'>Heaven is resting. Heaven is resting.</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i6'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/q'unodle_dran_xindighe'oy.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i6w'><span class="word" id="i6w0">Q’unodle</span><span class="word" id="i6w1">chux</span><span class="word" id="i6w2">xindighe’oy.</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i6g'><span class="gloss" id="i6g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i6g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i6g2"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i6ft'>Which stands up for Christmas.</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i7'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/didlang_chux.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i7w'><span class="word" id="i7w0">Didlang</span><span class="word" id="i7w1">chux,</span><span class="word" id="i7w2">didlang</span><span class="word" id="i7w3">chux</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i7g'><span class="gloss" id="i7g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i7g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i7g2"></span><span class="gloss" id="i7g3"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i7ft'>Big spruce, big spruce</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i8'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/q'unodle_dran_xindighe'oy.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i8w'><span class="word" id="i8w0">Q’unodle</span><span class="word" id="i8w1">dran</span><span class="word" id="i8w2">xindighe’oy.</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i8g'><span class="gloss" id="i8g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i8g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i8g2"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i8ft'>which stands up on Christmas day.</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i9'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/sraqay_getiy_ngughun'_srixidal-ts'eyh.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i9w'><span class="word" id="i9w0">Sraqay</span><span class="word" id="i9w1">getiy</span><span class="word" id="i9w2">ngughun’</span><span class="word" id="i9w3">sixidaɬts’eyh.</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i9g'><span class="gloss" id="i9g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i9g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i9g2"></span><span class="gloss" id="i9g3"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i9ft'>The children are very happy about you.</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i10'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/getiy_ngizren_axa_xiditl'e.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i10w'><span class="word" id="i10w0">Getiy</span><span class="word" id="i10w1">ngizren</span><span class="word" id="i10w2">axa</span><span class="word" id="i10w3">xiditl’e.</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i10g'><span class="gloss" id="i10g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i10g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i10g2"></span><span class="gloss" id="i10g3"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i10ft'>It’s decorated with very nice things.</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i11'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/didlang_chux.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i11w'><span class="word" id="i11w0">Didlang</span><span class="word" id="i11w1">chux,</span><span class="word" id="i11w2">didlang</span><span class="word" id="i11w3">chux</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i11g'><span class="gloss" id="i11g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i11g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i11g2"></span><span class="gloss" id="i11g3"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i11ft'>Big spruce, big spruce</span></p></li>
<li><p class='igt' id='i12'><a href="//depts.washington.edu/dxmedia/Gileg/q'unodle_dran_xindighe'oy.mp3" class='audio'>hidden</a><span class='words' id='i12w'><span class="word" id="i12w0">Q’unodle</span><span class="word" id="i12w1">dran</span><span class="word" id="i12w2">xindighe’oy.</span></span><span class='glosses' id='i12g'><span class="gloss" id="i12g0"></span><span class="gloss" id="i12g1"></span><span class="gloss" id="i12g2"></span></span><br /><span class='trans' id='i12ft'>Which stands up on Christmas day.</span></p></li>
</ol></div><div id='notes'><h2>Notes</h2><ol></ol>
